WEBVTT

00:00:03.110 --> 00:00:07.770
The gentle type that is the color green

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:05.430
Zhou-ji Jao-feng!

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:13.240
owns a cement mixer that can call up a storm.

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:19.660
It is an ally of the weak.

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:18.750
FuRyu!

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:19.840
RaiRyu!

00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:25.400
The yellow one wields lightning

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:23.380
Start combat mode!

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:24.380
Roger!

00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:26.790
TiGao 4!

00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:30.710
along with the power to fly through the sky

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:29.080
Rei!

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:31.120
TiGao 2!

00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:37.440
their growling hearts are unstoppable

00:00:32.030 --> 00:00:33.620
Feng Dao Dan!

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.830
The 31 Machine Primevals have fused with the Great Wall of China...

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.560
...transforming countless tourists into Zonder Robos, and are now on the attack.

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:43.480
Those mecha bodies!

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:46.870
But in an attempt to rescue the newly-built A.I. robots from China...

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:45.830
Gan, gan, gan, ga-gan!

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:55.180
Strongest Brave Robo Corps!

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:50.740
...HyoRyu and EnRyu have vanished inside the massive bombardment!

00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:52.980
FuRyu and RaiRyu...

00:00:53.050 --> 00:00:55.570
The path to victory in this battle...

00:00:55.850 --> 00:01:00.180
Is it up to these two to lead the way?

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:03.240
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:06.140
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:13.140
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:13.510 --> 00:01:17.760
Run, you powerful Robot Brigade!

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:23.990
With your red gaze and your silver chest!

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:28.080
The G-Stone is your bond with the lion

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:32.780
to save the future of outer space.

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:36.740
It's time to launch!

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:39.920
Destroying the souls of the people...

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:43.840
Smash the Zonder Metal to pieces!

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:48.540
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:51.500
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:54.420
}Final Fusion, approved!

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:57.170
Now transform into a superhero!

00:01:57.380 --> 00:02:00.680
Pulverizing steel!

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:04.350
Goldion Hammer!

00:02:06.210 --> 00:02:11.880
Magic! Drive! Ultimate power! Guts!

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:17.880
A hero is born! Great God of Iron...

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:20.700
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:24.880
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:29.040
You are hereby ordered to fuse with the Ultimate King of Braves legend!

00:02:32.050 --> 00:02:32.090
His Name is GekiRyuJin

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:35.250
<i>His Name is GekiRyuJin</i>

00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:42.760
ZX-05 has pierced the Mohorovic Discontinuity!

00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:45.150
No! That energy level...

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:55.270
So this is the top, huh?

00:02:55.700 --> 00:02:56.860
All right!

00:02:57.470 --> 00:02:58.700
I'll smash you to pieces!

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:21.930
That's an unbelievable amount of energy!

00:03:24.030 --> 00:03:26.400
GaoGaiGar has sustained damage to his main thrusters!

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:29.740
Damn!

00:03:29.800 --> 00:03:33.210
The massive output from the Ul-Tech Engine put too much strain on my parts!

00:03:35.380 --> 00:03:36.310
Gai!

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:38.470
Ushi, what's the Amaterasu's position?

00:03:39.050 --> 00:03:40.670
It's in the upper atmosphere!

00:03:40.850 --> 00:03:42.870
Distance from GaoGaiGar, 8,000!

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:49.360
It's no good!

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:51.150
I can't stop myself from plunging!

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:55.030
Amaterasu?

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:16.450
Having fused with the Great Wall of China...

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:20.880
...ZX-05 is much like a colossal tower piercing the heavens.

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:23.510
And it is storing energy from the mantle layer...

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:25.920
...even as it maintains an ominous silence.

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:31.730
Probability 99.73%.

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:33.390
It's an almost absolute certainty.

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:36.530
That thing is targeting the Orbit Base!

00:04:55.590 --> 00:04:57.020
Captain, sir.

00:04:58.060 --> 00:04:59.990
I see that you made it through somehow.

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:01.280
HyoRyu...

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:02.390
EnRyu...

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:05.020
You both got really banged up, didn't you?

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:08.900
This level of damage is no more than what humans would call scratches.

00:05:09.140 --> 00:05:12.770
Once they replace our armor, we'll be ready to go into battle anytime!

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:15.230
Right. That's the spirit, guys!

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:22.270
Forgive me for not getting here sooner.

00:05:23.020 --> 00:05:24.280
ZX-05...

00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:26.780
According to my estimates, it will take...

00:05:26.890 --> 00:05:29.720
...another 160 minutes for it to achieve a full energy charge.

00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:31.750
160 minutes...

00:05:32.530 --> 00:05:34.360
And it's dusk now in China.

00:05:47.140 --> 00:05:50.270
Of all our tactical objectives, the one with the highest priority is...

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:51.740
...to repel the enemy.

00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:54.840
And our 2nd priority is to protect ourselves.

00:05:55.050 --> 00:05:57.640
That's right. And yet, HyoRyu and EnRyu...

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:10.890
They protected us and ended up getting wounded in our place.

00:06:11.070 --> 00:06:14.190
Yeah. Incomprehensible, isn't it?

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:26.120
Rai                                RaiRyu

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:26.120
Fu                                 FuRyu

00:06:26.680 --> 00:06:29.080
What's keeping their SympaRate from rising?

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:32.340
If FuRyu and RaiRyu succeed in combining...

00:06:32.420 --> 00:06:36.980
...they'll become GekiRyuJin, the most powerful combat robot on Earth.

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:54.770
ZX-05...

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:58.170
This time, for sure, I'm going to stop you!

00:07:00.780 --> 00:07:02.220
You're Pizza!

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:04.080
No, Soldato-J!

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:08.990
That is correct, Cyborg Gai.

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:10.720
Mamoru told me all about it.

00:07:11.230 --> 00:07:14.130
Your goal is to collect all of the so-called...

00:07:14.230 --> 00:07:16.960
...Zonder Crystals from the Purified Primeval cores.

00:07:17.060 --> 00:07:20.930
And he said that you warned us not to get in your way!

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:24.970
What are these Zonder Crystals, anyway?

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:27.610
What are you planning to do once you've collected them?

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:31.670
I have a mission that I must accomplish.

00:07:31.780 --> 00:07:34.340
Our showdown will have to wait until after it's done.

00:07:34.820 --> 00:07:36.550
That's what I came to tell you today.

00:07:36.550 --> 00:07:37.540
Come back here!

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:41.690
Those Primevals haven't fully awakened yet.

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:46.020
If you act now, you Earthlings still have a chance of winning.

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:47.290
Farewell!

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:54.330
Soldato-J...

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:02.470
Big Brother Gai!

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:05.270
Mamoru! What are you doing here?

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:06.870
Volfogg!

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:10.680
Considering our current situation, I judged that we needed Mamoru.

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:12.050
So I escorted him here.

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:12.780
I see.

00:08:13.150 --> 00:08:14.950
Thanks a lot for showing up, Mamoru.

00:08:17.960 --> 00:08:19.090
All right!

00:08:19.260 --> 00:08:22.530
Now that you're here, I can fight at maximum power with no worries!

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:27.030
If something happens, I'm gonna ask you to adjust my G-Stone, okay?

00:08:27.170 --> 00:08:28.140
Mamoru?

00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:30.160
Okay!

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:31.770
Waha!

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:33.440
Waha!

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:41.480
Orbit Base, this is the Ground Unit.

00:08:41.550 --> 00:08:45.380
All maintenance on the GaoMachines, HyoRyu and EnRyu is done.

00:08:45.490 --> 00:08:47.180
We're all set to go into battle.

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:50.490
We're sending The 13th into combat.

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:52.990
We'll give you as much support as you need with Disc P!

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:57.400
Big Brother, don't be so stingy! Can't you use Disc X, for heaven's sake?

00:08:57.470 --> 00:09:01.560
Didn't you say it could destroy anything within attack range in outer space?

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:05.800
We depleted our Disc X supply during that battle the other day!

00:09:05.970 --> 00:09:08.840
And for your information, they're not so easy to make!

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:10.070
Oh, for crying out loud!

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:13.200
In other words it's useless just when we need it the most, geez!

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:14.510
What did you say?

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:16.410
Now, now, both of you...

00:09:16.520 --> 00:09:17.110
Hmph!

00:09:17.550 --> 00:09:19.990
All right, we're going to start the operation now.

00:09:20.520 --> 00:09:25.580
Objective, to attack ZX-05 simultaneously from the ground and air.

00:09:25.730 --> 00:09:27.130
Then annihilate it!

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:29.060
GGG, mobilize!

00:09:47.050 --> 00:09:49.140
Fusion!

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:02.020
GaiGar!

00:10:03.760 --> 00:10:05.860
Final Fusion, approved!

00:10:06.130 --> 00:10:07.100
Roger!

00:10:07.230 --> 00:10:08.360
Final Fusion!

00:10:08.900 --> 00:10:10.630
Program Drive!

00:10:14.580 --> 00:10:18.100
Final Fusion!

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:50.470
GaoGaiGar!

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:52.570
Here I come!

00:10:59.750 --> 00:11:02.850
EnRyu, you understand what our mission is, don't you?

00:11:02.990 --> 00:11:04.510
Of course I do!

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:07.620
My A.I. System's the best in the world!

00:11:07.760 --> 00:11:10.290
We're going to rescue the people who've been turned into Zonder cores.

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:13.330
And then we're going to destroy the earthbound sections of ZX-05...

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:15.770
...to cut off the supply of magma energy!

00:11:16.140 --> 00:11:18.730
As of right now, of all our ground troops...

00:11:18.810 --> 00:11:21.370
...the robots with the greatest attack capacity are...

00:11:21.510 --> 00:11:22.670
...those two.

00:11:24.150 --> 00:11:27.510
For this operation, we should take on a supporting role.

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:30.080
That just doesn't sit well with me!

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:31.550
It really can't be helped.

00:11:31.850 --> 00:11:35.580
Since those two have no intention of saving the Zonderized humans...

00:11:35.720 --> 00:11:37.590
...we're going to have to pick up after them.

00:11:37.660 --> 00:11:38.890
Darn!

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:45.620
All right! FuRyu, RaiRyu... time to System Change!

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:47.730
Zhou-ji Jao-feng!

00:11:57.680 --> 00:11:58.210
FuRyu!

00:11:58.210 --> 00:11:59.340
RaiRyu!

00:12:11.090 --> 00:12:13.560
Waha! Those are the new robots, huh?

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:16.720
All right, let us set off as well.

00:12:16.860 --> 00:12:17.390
Right!

00:12:17.930 --> 00:12:19.520
Ul-Tech Engine, start!

00:12:27.340 --> 00:12:30.940
You can just act as shields for FuRyu and RaiRyu...

00:12:31.050 --> 00:12:32.840
...Brave Robots of the GGG.

00:12:44.690 --> 00:12:47.420
System Change!

00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:52.300
Mic Sounders the 13th!

00:12:53.400 --> 00:12:55.300
C'mon, rock 'n' roll!

00:12:57.640 --> 00:12:59.540
Disc P, set on!

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:05.040
Thundering...

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:07.740
...V!

00:13:09.550 --> 00:13:10.850
Hey, GaoGaiGar!

00:13:11.020 --> 00:13:14.390
Shout out as loud as you want to the sound of Mic's Disc P!

00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:15.320
Right!

00:13:17.760 --> 00:13:19.390
All right!

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:25.430
TiGao 2!

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:26.960
Feng Dao Dan!

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:28.460
TiGao 4!

00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:30.060
Rei!

00:13:34.310 --> 00:13:35.040
What the!

00:13:39.610 --> 00:13:40.810
Three Become One!

00:13:49.990 --> 00:13:54.090
Big Volfogg!

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:56.490
Melting Siren!

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:03.530
Now's our chance, EnRyu!

00:14:03.600 --> 00:14:04.230
Right!

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:10.600
Take that! Take that! Take that! Take that!

00:14:19.150 --> 00:14:21.120
Don't just sit there, follow us!

00:14:30.530 --> 00:14:32.230
Hmm, they're putting up quite a good fight.

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:35.630
Hello there, Professor.

00:14:35.870 --> 00:14:37.570
Greetings, Dr. Shishioh.

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:40.770
I'm impressed by your GGG robots.

00:14:41.180 --> 00:14:44.240
They're doing a good job supporting FuRyu and RaiRyu.

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:49.810
Professor, these Primevals have the ability to self-regenerate...

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:55.120
...so even if we keep attacking like just now, it's not going to be effective.

00:14:55.820 --> 00:14:57.090
Then what do you propose?

00:14:57.630 --> 00:15:00.960
Those two haven't been able to pull off Symmetrical Docking yet, right?

00:15:02.660 --> 00:15:03.600
Well...

00:15:03.760 --> 00:15:08.830
I hope that FuRyu and RaiRyu's A.I. matures a bit during this operation.

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:09.770
Goodbye...

00:15:11.740 --> 00:15:13.870
But they're perfect A.I. clones.

00:15:13.940 --> 00:15:16.430
So why won't their SympaRates increase?

00:15:23.820 --> 00:15:25.680
Broken Magnum!

00:15:38.570 --> 00:15:39.500
What the!

00:15:42.140 --> 00:15:44.000
High-pressure magnetic waves are headed this way!

00:15:44.470 --> 00:15:46.410
Can it really fire from that angle?

00:15:46.770 --> 00:15:50.570
GS Generator full power! Turn on Protect Shade!

00:15:50.710 --> 00:15:52.740
Protect Shade switched on!

00:16:09.060 --> 00:16:11.760
All energy from impact successfully deflected!

00:16:24.380 --> 00:16:27.940
HyoRyu! EnRyu! We're going to launch the Eraserhead!

00:16:28.220 --> 00:16:29.180
Roger!

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:32.210
Symmetrical Docking!

00:16:54.380 --> 00:16:58.680
ChoRyuJin!

00:17:06.450 --> 00:17:08.940
Eraserhead, launch!

00:17:18.870 --> 00:17:20.270
No damage whatsoever to the Primeval!

00:17:20.870 --> 00:17:24.170
Zonder!

00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:26.730
Have the Zonder robots regenerated?

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:28.410
We'll never get rid of it this way!

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:39.840
Amazing! So that's the power of Symmetrical Docking.

00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:42.280
All right!

00:17:42.890 --> 00:17:45.520
Ul-Tech Engine, start!

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:54.370
The Primeval's recharging its energy. Now's our chance!

00:18:07.510 --> 00:18:11.180
Goldion Hammer!

00:18:13.850 --> 00:18:14.590
No!

00:18:14.590 --> 00:18:15.850
No! I won't let you get in the way!

00:18:18.060 --> 00:18:20.550
Transform into light!

00:18:22.730 --> 00:18:23.660
This looks bad!

00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:32.700
At this rate, GaoGaiGar will get blasted to pieces!

00:18:32.940 --> 00:18:34.930
There are too many of them!

00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:37.330
FuRyu! RaiRyu!

00:18:38.180 --> 00:18:39.870
Destroying the Zonder Robot...

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:41.840
...that's our job!

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:44.180
Their SympaRate!

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:48.610
All right, that's it! FuRyu! RaiRyu!

00:18:49.290 --> 00:18:51.880
Symmetrical Docking!

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:19.350
GekiRyuJin!

00:19:23.920 --> 00:19:26.760
Roar, Hurricane! Split the sky, Lightning!

00:19:27.260 --> 00:19:29.860
Shuan Tou Long!

00:19:38.270 --> 00:19:41.900
No! If you do that you'll destroy the Zonderized humans as well!

00:19:54.560 --> 00:19:59.320
Tactical Objective No. 1, rescue the Zonder cores, complete.

00:20:00.890 --> 00:20:02.760
GekiRyuJin, you...

00:20:03.160 --> 00:20:05.500
Our top priority is the preservation of human life.

00:20:05.570 --> 00:20:07.930
That's what you wished for, right, ChoRyuJin?

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:12.360
That's precisely what led to your successful Symmetrical Docking.

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:14.340
You've grown up, you're a true hero.

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:15.800
A true hero?

00:20:16.210 --> 00:20:19.180
Thank you. That's the greatest compliment I could ever receive.

00:20:37.330 --> 00:20:40.860
No! ZX-05's body is underground!

00:20:41.070 --> 00:20:43.730
Could it be that the Primeval core is inside the Mantle Layer?

00:20:43.870 --> 00:20:46.460
It's impossible to track it with the technology we have now!

00:20:58.950 --> 00:21:01.150
I've been waiting for you, 31 Primevals!

00:21:01.390 --> 00:21:02.880
Fusion!

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:07.650
J-Bird! Plug out!

00:21:09.900 --> 00:21:12.160
Mega-Fusion!

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:33.950
King J-Der!

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:46.330
5-Linked Maser Cannons!

00:21:53.340 --> 00:21:55.710
26 remaining!

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:00.770
Now confirming the annihilation of ZX-05.

00:22:01.080 --> 00:22:04.280
From its wave pattern, it appears to be King J-Der!

00:22:10.160 --> 00:22:11.920
Curatio!

00:22:12.660 --> 00:22:14.150
Teneritas!

00:22:14.360 --> 00:22:15.890
Sectio!

00:22:16.360 --> 00:22:17.460
Salus!

00:22:17.960 --> 00:22:19.400
Coctura!

00:22:25.810 --> 00:22:30.110
The miraculous Symmetrical Docking has given birth to GekiRyuJin.

00:22:30.340 --> 00:22:33.110
Now that this newest brave warrior has been born...

00:22:33.180 --> 00:22:38.050
...the road to victory has been carved deeply before our eyes.

00:22:46.470 --> 00:22:50.370
Even if there are more than a million stars between us...

00:22:51.570 --> 00:22:55.240
...I know I can get there without losing my way.

00:22:56.640 --> 00:23:01.420
Because I can see the road that leads to you.

00:23:01.420 --> 00:23:06.210
It's sparkling ahead of me.

00:23:06.840 --> 00:23:10.380
The journey I began that day...

00:23:11.550 --> 00:23:17.310
...will surely make our bond even stronger.

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:24.070
The wings that send me into the galaxy...

00:23:24.070 --> 00:23:28.730
...let's believe in them now.

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:34.070
When you and I are grown up

00:23:34.070 --> 00:23:41.070
someday in the Sea of Stars.

